OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 17 JUN
OL,4,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,5,     GUkraine-born Vadym Kholodenko
OL,6,     Gplays Rachmaninov's second piano
OL,7,     Gconcerto with the BBC National
OL,8,     GOrchestra of Wales. The programme
OL,9,     Gstarts with Bacewicz's Concerto
OL,10,     Gfor String Orchestra.
OL,11,G0630FBreakfast
OL,12,     GLive from Horsey Windpump, Tom
OL,13,     Gexplores the Norfolk Broads
OL,14,     Gthrough the music and people of
OL,15,     Gthe area. With music inspired by
OL,16,     Gthe sea from Olivia Chaney.
OL,17,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,18,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,19,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,20,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,21,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
