OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 17 JUN
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GAl Ryan introduces Debussy &
OL,6,     GLiszt from the Royal Liverpool
OL,7,     GPhilharmonic Orchestra, plus
OL,8,     GBeethoven from the Chaos Quartet
OL,9,     Gand pianist Julius Asal playing
OL,10,     GBartok & Schumann.
OL,11,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,12,     GLive from the Chapel of Clare
OL,13,     GCollege, Cambridge, with music by
OL,14,     GJohn Rutter, Howells, Nico Muhly
OL,15,     Gand Hovland.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Anonymous
OL,17,     GDonald Macleod presents musical
OL,18,     Gworks ascribed to named composers
OL,19,     Gwhose true authors have been
OL,20,     Ghidden, confused, and even
OL,21,     Gdeliberately obscured.
